+	// Geometry FIFO command stream (i960 -> SHARC copro). Logs every
+	// write to the 0x884000 port with the writing PC and i960 R6/G0/G2.
+	// The transform emitters send a per-part opcode packet
+	// `5 47 <off0..2> 22 <rotA> 21 <rotB> 20 <rotC> 58 <read> [6]`
+	// (advance, fixed-point interpolation, Z/Y/X rotation, seeded
+	// output, decrement); the 0x93560 sequencer sends `5 18 ...`. The
+	// PC/time windows are env-tunable (VON_FIFO_T0/T1, VON_FIFO_PC_MIN/
+	// PC_MAX, VON_FIFO_MAX) so the full opcode program is capturable.
